{"v":4,"catch":"用超高空戰鬥轟炸機RAIDEN擊落強大的敵人!","desc":"\"RAIDEN\"是SEIBU KAIHATSU在1990年發布的一款射擊遊戲。\n登上超高空戰鬥轟炸機RAIDEN，保護地球免遭突如其來的外星人入侵。\n各種各樣的階段和力量增強的項目為你提供了大量的刺激，供你享受。\n\n“Arcade Archives”系列忠實再現了許多經典的Arcade傑作。\n玩家可以改變各種遊戲設置，例如遊戲難度，並且還可以重現那時的街機顯示設置的氛圍。 玩家也可以通過高分來與世界各地的選手展開競爭。\n請享受為視頻遊戲打造一代的傑作。","publisher":"HAMSTER","release":"2021-07-01","genres":["射擊","街機"],"players":"單機 1–2 人","langs":["日文","英文","西班牙文","法文","德文","意大利文"],"pmax":2,"poff":2,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.1GB / Switch 0.1GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/17cc7d9ab6016d924d5404e5a3e16eadfaab26f806a805032153c73c54a3c927.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/c989bd21d6dd76e8efb26468f1130bd298063577448666807cd26f27d832a31d.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/6841328ecc0dc0cbeaa9dda131ba125485fb04f11e1ff24c500b396dc66f0dd0.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/40f97ca84d8895f77376422cdf0248efd4ebbd50ef918e94fbec65e28ed57a71.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/a04abdd065d397c23f102e9d881a105cb8fe912cc8c2954f1f07f6060fff935a.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/dd6ac62b9ddc02c57e61fc5e61d45f7368cd3ff364a6d68751a0c676bd9e27e7.jpg"],"titleId":"010025e0131a6000","dlc":[]}